{
 "intro": "Paperplane's cloud network drawn as a bench. Each subnet is a VLAN on sw1, and the router's rules play the cloud's security groups. The 20 workers on 10.40.1.0/24 are the miners the attacker started with the leaked key.",
 "tasks": [
