   "id": "pool",
   "text": "Cut the miners off: none of them reach the mining pool or your servers",
   "hint": "The pool is 198.51.100.88 on tcp 3333. You can shut the workers' subnet at the switch, or write rules on gw for 10.40.1.0/24.",
